  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>PayloadArgumentResolver</code> with the given\n<a href=\"../../../converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> and <a href=\"../../../../validation/Validator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的带有给定<a href=\"../../../converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>和<a href=\"../../../../validation/Validator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a>的<code>PayloadArgumentResolver</code>。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>messageConverter</code> - the MessageConverter to use (required)",
      "translation": "<code>messageConverter</code> - 要使用的 MessageConverter（必需）",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>PayloadArgumentResolver</code> with the given\n<a href=\"../../../converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的带有给定<a href=\"../../../converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>的<code>PayloadArgumentResolver</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>validator</code> - the Validator to use (optional)",
      "translation": "<code>validator</code> - 要使用的验证器（可选）",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Validation is applied if the method argument is annotated with\n<a href=\"../../../../validation/annotation/Validated.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.validation.annotation\"><code>Validated</code></a> or\n<code>@jakarta.validation.Valid</code>. Validation failure results in an\n<a href=\"MethodArgumentNotValidException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MethodArgumentNotValidException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果方法参数标注了 <a href=\"../../../../validation/annotation/Validated.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.validation.annotation\"><code>Validated</code></a> 或 <code>@jakarta.validation.Valid</code>，则应用验证。验证失败将导致抛出 <a href=\"MethodArgumentNotValidException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MethodArgumentNotValidException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default this is simply <a href=\"../../../../core/MethodParameter.html#getParameterType()\"><code>MethodParameter.getParameterType()</code></a>\nbut that can be overridden to select a more specific target type after\nalso taking into account the \"Content-Type\", for example, return <code>String</code>\nif target type is <code>Object</code> and <code>\"Content-Type:text/**\"</code>.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，这仅仅是<a href=\"../../../../core/MethodParameter.html#getParameterType()\"><code>MethodParameter.getParameterType()</code></a>，但可以通过重写该方法来选择更具体的目标类型，同时考虑\"Content-Type\"。例如，如果目标类型是<code>Object</code>且<code>\"Content-Type:text/**\"</code>，则返回<code>String</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This <a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> should be ordered last as it\nsupports all types and does not require the <a href=\"../Payload.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>Payload</code></a> annotation.",
      "translation": "此 `<a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>` 应排在最后，因为它支持所有类型且不需要 `<a href=\"../Payload.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>Payload</code></a>` 注解。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Specify if the given <code>payload</code> is empty.",
      "translation": "指定给定的<code>payload</code>是否为空。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the given <a href=\"../../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">method parameter</a> is\nsupported by this resolver.",
      "translation": "给定<a href=\"../../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">方法参数</a>是否由该解析器支持。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves a method parameter into an argument value from a given message.",
      "translation": "将方法参数解析为来自给定消息的参数值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Validate the payload if applicable.",
      "translation": "如适用，请验证负载。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>useDefaultResolution</code> - if \"true\" (the default) this resolver supports\nall parameters; if \"false\" then only arguments with the <code>@Payload</code>\nannotation are supported.",
      "translation": "<code>useDefaultResolution</code> - 如果为 \"true\"（默认值），此解析器支持所有参数；如果为 \"false\"，则仅支持带有 <code>@Payload</code> 注解的参数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"MethodArgumentNotValidException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\">MethodArgumentNotValidException</a></code> - in case of binding errors",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"MethodArgumentNotValidException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\">MethodArgumentNotValidException</a></code> - 在绑定错误时",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>message</code> - the currently processed message",
      "translation": "<code>message</code> - 当前正在处理的消息",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>target</code> - the target payload object",
      "translation": "<code>target</code> - 目标负载对象",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Rossen Stoyanchev, Juergen Hoeller, Brian Clozel, Stephane Nicoll",
      "translation": "Rossen Stoyanchev、Juergen Hoeller、Brian Clozel 和 Stephane Nicoll",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the target class to convert the payload to.",
      "translation": "解析目标类以转换负载。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">supportsParameter</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">supportsParameter</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">resolveArgument</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">resolveArgument</a>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter to resolve.\nThis parameter must have previously been passed to\n<a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)</code></a>\nwhich must have returned <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>parameter</code> - 要解析的方法参数。此参数必须先前已传递给<a href=\"../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该调用必须返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if this resolver supports the supplied parameter;\n<code>false</code> otherwise",
      "translation": "<code>true</code> 如果此解析器支持提供的参数；否则为 <code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - in case of errors with the preparation of argument values",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - 在准备参数值时发生错误的情况下",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
